{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:32429262bcbcb55f","name":"Luka Sene Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-32429262bcbcb55f","title":"Luka Sene Talent Tree","revision":19229,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T21:33:47Z","sha256":"d44949cae7ad14fc2b43f758bfcf4bd4b19b3dc83344eafa7c2bb0542e187ebe","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19229","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Luka%20Sene%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-32429262bcbcb55f","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["The Luka Sene"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Luka_Sene","referenceId":"reference:c5016e4233ace6a5"}," build upon the natural ",{"tag":"a","children":["Miralukan"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Miralukan"}," sense-based abilities. Only Force-users that are part of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Luka Sene"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Luka_Sene","referenceId":"reference:c5016e4233ace6a5"}," may select ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talents"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talents","referenceId":"reference:e8871b70ebfa07d9"}," from this tree.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Field Detection"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},", make a DC 15 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check. If the check succeeds, you can detect the presence, general strength, and origin (or direction of origin if the source is out of range) of electromagnetic and energy fields within 12 squares of you. You can also determine the type of field, allowing you to detect ",{"tag":"a","children":["Communications Devices"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Communications_Devices"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Detection and Surveillance Devices"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Detection_and_Surveillance_Devices"},", and other electronic ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When dealing damage to a person or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," using a personal shield, or to a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," with shields active, a successful check allows you to detect minute fluctuations in the shield, reducing their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Shield Rating"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Shield_Rating"}," by -5 against your attacks until the end of your turn.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Improved Force Sight"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Miraluka"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Miraluka","referenceId":"reference:3420ef4c6355dcff"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Your natural Force Sight is more precise than that of your fellow ",{"tag":"a","children":["Miraluka"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Miraluka","referenceId":"reference:3420ef4c6355dcff"},". You can use the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Search"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Search"}," application of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," skill as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},". Additionally, you always succeed when using the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sense Surroundings"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sense_Surroundings"}," application of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," skill (no roll required).\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Luka Sene Master"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Field Detection"]},", ",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Farseeing"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Farseeing","referenceId":"reference:efdb098bc15b650e"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You are a Master of Luka Sene techniques and an expert in using sense-related ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talents"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talents","referenceId":"reference:e8871b70ebfa07d9"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Powers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Powers","referenceId":"reference:85acec94cd1ca5f3"},". Once per encounter, you gain a temporary ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," that you must spend when activating a Talent from either the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sense Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sense_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:46e56880052eaad2"}," or Luka Sene Talent Tree, when using the ",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Farseeing"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Farseeing","referenceId":"reference:efdb098bc15b650e"}]}," Force Power, or on a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check made to use the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Search Your Feelings"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Search_Your_Feelings"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sense Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sense_Force"}," applications of the skill. The ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," is lost if not used before the end of the encounter.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Quickseeing"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"},", ",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Farseeing"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Farseeing","referenceId":"reference:efdb098bc15b650e"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Free Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Free_Action"}," on your turn, you can make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check against a living creature within 12 squares, removing one use of the ",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Farseeing"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Farseeing","referenceId":"reference:efdb098bc15b650e"}]}," Force Power from your active ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power Suite"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power_Suite"}," (as though you had activated the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"},"). If your check result equals or exceeds the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"}," of the target, you gain a +2 insight bonus on attack rolls against that target until the end of your turn. This counts as using the ",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Farseeing"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Farseeing","referenceId":"reference:efdb098bc15b650e"}]}," Force Power against that target, but this Talent replaces the normal rules and effects of that ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
